[01:18:12] [INFO] [step_11_eht_polarization] 
[01:18:12] [INFO] [step_11_eht_polarization]   TEP does not predict observable birefringence in the exterior.
[01:18:12] [INFO] [step_11_eht_polarization]   The conformal factor A ~ 1 and the disformal term B ~ 0 in
[01:18:12] [INFO] [step_11_eht_polarization]   the exterior, so photon polarization is unaffected.
[01:18:12] [INFO] [step_11_eht_polarization]   The observed low polarization fraction (~4-7%) is not
